    "actual_capabilities": [
      "Explains RESTful route structures and common request patterns for backend APIs.",
      "Shows repository and service layer patterns for separating business logic from data access.",
      "Demonstrates query optimization, batching, transactions, and Redis cache-aside strategies.",
      "Covers authentication middleware, JWT validation, role checks, and simple rate limiting.",
      "Provides examples for retries, background queues, centralized errors, and structured logging."
    ],
    "limitations": [
      "It provides reference patterns, not a complete production framework.",
      "Most examples assume TypeScript, Node.js, Express, Next.js, Supabase, or Redis knowledge.",
